    <p class="meta">Ideal Rugs · Update completed 8 September 2026</p>

    <p>
      We’ve applied your freight table across the live catalogue.
      Each rug size now includes the correct Australia-wide delivery amount in its price,
      so customers see one clear total on the product page.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      Delivery cost is built into the price by size — smaller rugs include less, larger rugs include more — matching the freight schedule you provided.
    </div>

