      *Mostly round rugs (e.g. “160cm Round”) where size format didn’t match the length table. Happy to apply a rule for these next if you’d like.
    </p>

    <h2>How freight was calculated</h2>
    <p>
      For each size (for example <code>160×230cm</code>), we used the <strong>shorter side</strong> as the package length,
      then added the matching freight amount from your table:
    </p>
    <table>
